{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47436","headline":"参同契明镜图诀诗二首 一 · 彭晓","name":"参同契明镜图诀诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"造化潜施迹莫穷，簇成真诀指蒙童。\n三篇秘列八环内，万象门开一镜中。\n离女驾龙爲木壻，坎男乘虎作金翁。\n同人好道宜精究，究得长生路便通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"彭晓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}